Endurance (v2) — a 35-second documentary short in the "Documentary Parallax" style

The photographs, the map and the newspaper are real public-domain documents, shown unaltered except for light, weather, water and the
lens moving over them (no colourising, no objects painted in). The two scenes tagged RECONSTRUCTION are built entirely in code and show
what no camera recorded; what they rest on and what is approximate is in RECONSTRUCTIONS.md. Every fact on screen is in FACTS.md /
FACTS-v2.md with its source and quoted wording; every image is in SOURCES.md / SOURCES-v2.md with its public-domain basis.

