Models used offline to prepare the photographs (their weights are not part of the film)
- Depth Anything V2 Small (Lihe Yang et al.), ONNX export by onnx-community — Apache License 2.0 — depth for the parallax layers
- LaMa inpainting (Suvorov et al., "big-lama"), ONNX export by Carve (huggingface.co/Carve/LaMa-ONNX) — Apache License 2.0 — fills what
  a nearer layer hides, revealed only at its edges when the camera moves

